  Ahmedabad:{tagline:'Decoration Services in Ahmedabad',about:'Surprised balloon decoration is Ahmedabad\'s trusted decoration service for birthdays, anniversaries, baby showers, balloon setups, room decoration and surprise parties. Whether you\'re planning a home birthday party in Bopal, an anniversary surprise in Vastrapur, a baby shower in Navrangpura or a kids\' theme party in Gota — our verified decorators bring everything to your doorstep and set it all up for you. We serve homes, societies, hotels and event venues across Ahmedabad. Packages start at ₹999 and include all materials — balloons, backdrops, props and professional setup.',why:['Serving 60+ areas across Ahmedabad','Verified & trained decorators','All materials included — balloons, backdrop, props','On-time setup guaranteed','Packages starting from ₹999'],services:[{heading:'Birthday Decoration in Ahmedabad',body:'Birthdays deserve a setup that feels special. We offer everything from simple balloon arches and foil number setups to full themed birthday rooms with backdrops, fairy lights and personalised name banners. Whether it\'s a 1st birthday, a sweet 16 or a milestone 50th, our decorators create the perfect atmosphere at your home or venue. Popular choices include pastel balloon arches, black-and-gold premium setups and character-themed kids\' parties.',link:'/decorations/birthday',linkText:'Browse birthday decoration packages'},{heading:'Balloon Decoration in Ahmedabad',body:'Balloons are at the heart of every great celebration. We specialise in balloon arches, organic balloon garlands, balloon bouquets, foil balloon setups and balloon backdrops for all occasions. Whether you need a simple balloon cluster for a home party or a grand arch for a venue event, our team brings the right balloons and sets them up beautifully. We use high-quality latex and foil balloons in any colour combination you choose.',link:'/decorations/balloon',linkText:'Explore balloon decoration options'},{heading:'Anniversary Decoration in Ahmedabad',body:'Surprise your partner with a beautifully decorated room, a romantic canopy setup or a candlelight arrangement. Our anniversary decoration packages include rose petal trails, balloon arches, fairy light canopies, backdrop setups and personalised messages. We set everything up while you\'re away so your partner walks into a completely transformed space. Perfect for 1st anniversaries, silver jubilees and everything in between.',link:'/decorations/anniversary',linkText:'See anniversary decoration packages'},{heading:'Baby Shower Decoration in Ahmedabad',body:'Celebrate the parents-to-be with a stunning baby shower setup. We offer gender reveal backdrops, Oh Baby balloon arches, pastel-themed setups and full baby shower decoration packages. Our team coordinates the colours, props and backdrop to match your chosen theme — whether it\'s a classic pink-and-white, a blue-and-gold setup or a nature-inspired theme. Available for home celebrations and venue events across Ahmedabad.',link:'/baby-shower-decorations',linkText:'View baby shower decoration packages'},{heading:'Home & Room Decoration in Ahmedabad',body:'Transform any room into a celebration space. Our home decoration service covers bedroom surprise setups, living room party decorations, terrace party setups and full home makeovers for special occasions. We bring all the materials — balloons, drapes, fairy lights, rose petals and props — and set everything up neatly. After the event, our team cleans up too. Ideal for surprise birthdays, anniversary reveals and romantic evenings.',link:'/room-decorations',linkText:'Explore room decoration packages'},{heading:'Party & Event Decoration in Ahmedabad',body:'Planning a party at home, in a society hall or at a venue? We handle decoration for kids\' birthday parties, adult celebrations, corporate events, naming ceremonies, baby welcome setups and more. Our event decoration packages are flexible — choose a simple setup or go all out with a premium themed experience. We serve homes, banquet halls, hotels and outdoor venues across Ahmedabad.',link:'/decorations/birthday',linkText:'Browse all party decoration packages'}],areaGroups:[{region:'West Ahmedabad',areas:'Bopal, South Bopal, Shela, Satellite, Prahlad Nagar, Vastrapur, Bodakdev, Thaltej, SG Highway, Shilaj, Science City, Ambli, Ghuma, Makarba, Chanakyapuri, Shyamal, Jodhpur, Vejalpur'},{region:'Central Ahmedabad',areas:'Navrangpura, Naranpura, Paldi, Ambawadi, Ellisbridge, Ashram Road, Memnagar, Gurukul, Nava Vadaj'},{region:'North Ahmedabad',areas:'Gota, Sola, Chandkheda, Motera, Sabarmati, Ranip, Chandlodia, Ghatlodia, Jagatpur, Ognaj, Hansol'},{region:'East Ahmedabad',areas:'Nikol, Naroda, Odhav, Vastral, Isanpur, Vatva, Ghodasar, Amraiwadi, Bapunagar, Rakhial, Ramol, Khokhra, CTM, Sindhu Bhavan Road'},{region:'South Ahmedabad',areas:'Maninagar, Juhapura, Sarkhej, Danilimda, Lambha, Behrampura, Kankaria, Shahibaug'}],faqs:[['What decoration services do you provide in Ahmedabad?','We provide birthday decoration, balloon decoration, anniversary decoration, baby shower decoration, room and home decoration, kids theme decoration, proposal decoration, car boot surprise, canopy decoration and party decoration across Ahmedabad.'],['How much does birthday decoration cost in Ahmedabad?','Birthday decoration packages start from ₹999. The price depends on the design, size and customisation. Premium setups with backdrops, foil balloons and fairy lights typically range from ₹2,500 to ₹10,000+.'],['Do you provide home birthday decoration in Ahmedabad?','Yes. Home birthday decoration is one of our most popular services. Our decorator comes to your home, sets up the decoration and clears everything after the event.'],['Do you provide balloon decoration in Ahmedabad?','Yes. We offer balloon arches, balloon bouquets, organic balloon garlands, foil balloon setups and balloon backdrops for all occasions across Ahmedabad.'],['Do you serve areas like Bopal, Satellite, Vastrapur and Bodakdev?','Yes. We serve all major areas in Ahmedabad including Bopal, South Bopal, Shela, Satellite, Prahlad Nagar, Vastrapur, Bodakdev, Thaltej, SG Highway, Navrangpura, Maninagar, Paldi, Gota, Chandkheda, Nikol, Naroda and 40+ more localities.'],['Can I book decoration for the same day?','Same-day bookings are available subject to decorator availability. For fastest confirmation, call or WhatsApp us directly at +91 97855 16343.'],['How do I book a decoration service in Ahmedabad?','You can book online by choosing a design on our website, or contact us directly on WhatsApp or phone. Share your event date, location and preferred design and we will confirm availability.'],['What is included in the decoration package?','All packages include balloons, backdrop or setup material and professional installation by a verified decorator. The decorator brings everything to your location — you do not need to arrange anything.'],['Can I customise the decoration theme and colours?','Yes. You can choose your preferred colour scheme, balloon style, backdrop design and add personalised messages or name banners before booking.'],['Do you decorate venues and hotels in Ahmedabad?','Yes. We decorate homes, society halls, hotel rooms, banquet halls, terraces and outdoor venues across Ahmedabad.']]},
